{"3790890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Demagost: Exodus", "steam_appid": 3790890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.poster.avif?t=1763485659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.webm?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.mp4?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ToD: Exodus leans heavily on story and narrative. You can explore the world map, but the main focus is story and village rebuilding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it's more casual, these is also hard difficulty which makes resource management a lot harder (but you should not need to restart due to death).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.poster.avif?t=1763485659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.webm?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.mp4?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story with multiple choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village rebuilding</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.poster.avif?t=1763485659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.webm?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/a7f03ca37d01a2927da744845e8e99a9.mp4?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ToD: Exodus leans heavily on story and narrative. You can explore the world map, but the main focus is story and village rebuilding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it's more casual, these is also hard difficulty which makes resource management a lot harder (but you should not need to restart due to death).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.poster.avif?t=1763485659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.webm?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/6a1df98604a1ed1b08d25f813df62f86.mp4?t=1763485659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story with multiple choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village rebuilding</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Your village got burned down, now resettle in a safe place, rebuild and train to take your revange. ToD is pretty casual story driven RPG that combines linear and open world parts.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/a40e24effe5fdfee4ad17fffb4fe088fe4153fa1/header.jpg?t=1763485659", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/8c8448799a5989376cb415ee612867cec59b1776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763485659", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/8c8448799a5989376cb415ee612867cec59b1776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763485659", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.